    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"Looping through movie_list, which contains tuples like (index, similarity_score), and we are doing the following for each one:\\n\",\n",
